    "detailed_description": "Silenthead: Ducks hunt is a horror game about hunting Silenthead! <br>You are plaing by the duck detective who need to find Silenthead and kill that beast.<br><br>The game divided in 2 parts:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Riding to the Silenthead<br>    In Riding section player will ride through forest road avoiding obstacles and enemies.<br></li><li> Killing Silenthead in 2d action horror tower<br>     In the Tower part player will play 2d shooter with multiple guns, multiple creepy enemies and a bossfight in each tower. <br>     The tower is procedurally generated. Player can get materials from enemies and craft ammo and some part for the weapons.</li></ul><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Scary atmosphere<br></li><li> Bossfights with Spooky Monster and Silenthead<br></li><li> Multiple guns<br></li><li> Creepy enemies<br></li><li> Crafting system</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Silenthead: Ducks hunt is a horror game about hunting Silenthead! <br>You are plaing by the duck detective who need to find Silenthead and kill that beast.<br><br>The game divided in 2 parts:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Riding to the Silenthead<br>    In Riding section player will ride through forest road avoiding obstacles and enemies.<br></li><li> Killing Silenthead in 2d action horror tower<br>     In the Tower part player will play 2d shooter with multiple guns, multiple creepy enemies and a bossfight in each tower. <br>     The tower is procedurally generated. Player can get materials from enemies and craft ammo and some part for the weapons.</li></ul><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Scary atmosphere<br></li><li> Bossfights with Spooky Monster and Silenthead<br></li><li> Multiple guns<br></li><li> Creepy enemies<br></li><li> Crafting system</li></ul>",
